<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  BCBSA RTT - Spanish TTS pronunciation lexicon (DRAFT)
  Generated with Claude AI - please review before distribution.

  IMPORTANT:
  1. xml:lang MUST match the locale of the Azure Spanish voice set in RTT
     (for example es-US or es-MX). A lexicon only works for one locale.
  2. Matching is case sensitive, so each casing variant needs its own lexeme.
  3. Longest phrases come first so the full phrase is matched before a sub-phrase.
  4. The alias spellings are Spanish-phonetic respellings. Have the Spanish SPOC
     listen and adjust them before go-live.

  v2 changes: Added BlueCard product line entries
  (BlueCard Access, BlueCard Eligibility, BlueCard PPO, BlueCard Traditional)
